    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-style-and-consistency-29-cc215da3-5e1a-4f98-913c-ec1eee2dd05c",
        "text": "###You started with a clear style.\n\nRepeated colors, shapes, and spacing help your page feel planned.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/f3cb9bd3ec62ddf8131668d33ce5de26-One palette, one coherent style-1.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right"
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-style-and-consistency-29-c917aa50-bf5c-4f46-a949-fef5c9b7a386",
        "text": "###Watch for style drift.\nA change can clash with the style you started with.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/77e8633bbeff7898b87371ff06dd2901-Angular hero clashes with rounded interface.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-style-and-consistency-29-99b13e14-681f-4d4d-a23a-cc040dc2a1d5",
        "text": "###Small changes add up.\nDifferent buttons, colors, and shapes can make the page feel unplanned.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/afd9a4365032b86c688a34813e2e2295-When website styles drift apart-4.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-style-and-consistency-29-b06446b7-09ac-4ffd-8f2d-9d7b1ea933d7",
        "text": "###Name your style.\nTell AI: “Use blue tones, rounded shapes, and generous spacing.”",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7f6889237c06678894c13097d71032c4-Blue tones, rounded shapes, open space.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-style-and-consistency-29-4ef13276-0b29-49e6-8d98-7d15b4ea009a",
        "text": "###Repeat it with each change.\nInclude your style in new prompts. Check that AI’s changes still match.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ce9531f139fad2a84160d5946006349e-Repeat the style, extend the page-5.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Watch a video demonstrating the importance of maintaining a consistent style. Observe how a site's style can drift after multiple changes and how naming and repeating the desired style helps maintain coherence.",
